    "body": "I don't immediately recall anything like that in the WIP impl. Actually I'm confused why user agent needs to provide such user interface.\r\n\r\nAnd yeah, I think the sentence here could be problematic. The document should be blocked by the modal dialog only when the dialog is the topmost element in the top layer, not just the topmost dialog element, otherwise if an element outside the dialog requests fullscreen, the fullscreen element would be blocked.",
